der’s) officers or directors (or Persons functioning in substantially similar roles) and the spouses, parents, descendants and siblings of such officers, directors or other Persons. As used in this definition, the term “control” of a Person means the possession, directly or indirectly, of the power to vote ten percent (10%) or more of any class of voting securities of such Person or to direct or cause the direction of the management or policies of a Person, whether through the ownership of voting securities, by contract or otherwise.","section":"","block":552,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-037421","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926037421/xbp-20251231xex10d15.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/133d3a1f49075f7784bb1d64071f804e99ddd1825e3c1d55916a0ee8323902a2.bin","sha256":"133d3a1f49075f7784bb1d64071f804e99ddd1825e3c1d55916a0ee8323902a2"}},{"id":"a4702e568998e3be756014749294cea6f57c45fbd2968043b1e773a93f9aa4e3","quote":"“Borrower Representative” means XBP Americas, LLC, in its capacity as Borrower Representative pursuant to the provisions of Section 2.9, or any successor Borrower Representative selected by Borrowers and approved by Agent.","context":"“Borrower” and “Borrowers” mean the entity(ies) described in the first paragraph of this Agreement and each of their successors and permitted assigns.","section":"","block":571,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-037421","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926037421/xbp-20251231xex10d15.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/133d3a1f49075f7784bb1d64071f804e99ddd1825e3c1d55916a0ee8323902a2.bin","sha256":"133d